{"logId": "fe94cab1-de62-449a-823e-ca86d8105da7", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "防溺水安全知识", "block_bbox": [103, 174, 268, 203], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[103.0, 174.0], [268.0, 174.0], [268.0, 203.0], [103.0, 203.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "（三）夏季游泳溺水自救方略", "block_bbox": [105, 213, 361, 239], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[105.0, 213.0], [361.0, 213.0], [361.0, 239.0], [105.0, 239.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "如何保证游泳的健康和安全，避免溺水事件的发生？对水情不熟而贸然下水，极易造成生命危险。万一不幸遇上了溺水事件，专家介绍，溺水者切莫慌张，应保持镇静，积极自救：", "block_bbox": [100, 248, 721, 346], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[100.0, 248.0], [721.0, 248.0], [721.0, 346.0], [100.0, 346.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）对于手脚抽筋者，若是手指抽筋，则可将手握拳，然后用力张开，迅速反复多做几次，直到抽筋消除为止；", "block_bbox": [100, 355, 724, 418], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[100.0, 355.0], [724.0, 355.0], [724.0, 418.0], [100.0, 418.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）若是小腿或脚趾抽筋，先吸一口气仰浮水上，用抽筋肢体对侧的手握住抽筋肢体的脚趾，并用力向身体方向拉，同时用同侧的手掌压在抽筋肢体的膝盖上，帮助抽筋腿伸直；", "block_bbox": [99, 427, 724, 524], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[99.0, 427.0], [724.0, 427.0], [724.0, 524.0], [99.0, 524.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（3）要是大腿抽筋的话，可同样采用拉长抽筋肌肉的办法解决。", "block_bbox": [137, 533, 692, 561], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[137.0, 533.0], [692.0, 533.0], [692.0, 561.0], [137.0, 561.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [759, 229, 799, 276], "block_id": 6, "block_order": null, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[759.0, 229.0], [799.0, 229.0], [799.0, 276.0], [759.0, 276.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [818, 206, 1107, 524], "block_id": 7, "block_order": null, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[818.0, 206.0], [1107.0, 206.0], [1107.0, 524.0], [818.0, 524.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "卫生与健康：", "block_bbox": [231, 790, 375, 819], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[231.0, 790.0], [375.0, 790.0], [375.0, 819.0], [231.0, 819.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、出行前了解所到地点的气候温度信息。备好服装和应急常用药品。", "block_bbox": [228, 831, 884, 858], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[228.0, 831.0], [884.0, 831.0], [884.0, 858.0], [228.0, 858.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、游玩要适度，娱乐要量力而行，保证游玩之余要有充足的休息时间。", "block_bbox": [228, 867, 904, 895], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[228.0, 867.0], [904.0, 867.0], [904.0, 895.0], [228.0, 895.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、饮食要卫生干净，不要暴饮暴食。饮酒不要过量，不强行劝酒，严禁酗酒。", "block_bbox": [228, 904, 968, 933], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[228.0, 904.0], [968.0, 904.0], [968.0, 933.0], [228.0, 933.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [268, 980, 520, 1203], "block_id": 12, "block_order": null, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[268.0, 980.0], [520.0, 980.0], [520.0, 1203.0], [268.0, 1203.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [625, 978, 889, 1211], "block_id": 13, "block_order": null, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[625.0, 978.0], [889.0, 978.0], [889.0, 1211.0], [625.0, 1211.0]]}, {"block_label": "footer_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [940, 1212, 1122, 1256], "block_id": 14, "block_order": null, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[940.0, 1212.0], [1122.0, 1212.0], [1122.0, 1256.0], [940.0, 1256.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8505358695983887, "coordinate": [103, 174, 268, 203], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[103.0, 174.0], [268.0, 174.0], [268.0, 203.0], [103.0, 203.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8364773988723755, "coordinate": [105, 213, 361, 239], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[105.0, 213.0], [361.0, 213.0], [361.0, 239.0], [105.0, 239.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9393317103385925, "coordinate": [100, 248, 721, 346], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[100.0, 248.0], [721.0, 248.0], [721.0, 346.0], [100.0, 346.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9240733981132507, "coordinate": [100, 355, 724, 418], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[100.0, 355.0], [724.0, 355.0], [724.0, 418.0], [100.0, 418.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9406688213348389, "coordinate": [99, 427, 724, 524], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[99.0, 427.0], [724.0, 427.0], [724.0, 524.0], [99.0, 524.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8325823545455933, "coordinate": [137, 533, 692, 561], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[137.0, 533.0], [692.0, 533.0], [692.0, 561.0], [137.0, 561.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.4495144188404083, "coordinate": [759, 229, 799, 276], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[759.0, 229.0], [799.0, 229.0], [799.0, 276.0], [759.0, 276.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.8561576008796692, "coordinate": [818, 206, 1107, 524], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[818.0, 206.0], [1107.0, 206.0], [1107.0, 524.0], [818.0, 524.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8215618133544922, "coordinate": [231, 790, 375, 819], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[231.0, 790.0], [375.0, 790.0], [375.0, 819.0], [231.0, 819.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8265993595123291, "coordinate": [228, 831, 884, 858], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[228.0, 831.0], [884.0, 831.0], [884.0, 858.0], [228.0, 858.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8273760676383972, "coordinate": [228, 867, 904, 895], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[228.0, 867.0], [904.0, 867.0], [904.0, 895.0], [228.0, 895.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8153155446052551, "coordinate": [228, 904, 968, 933], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[228.0, 904.0], [968.0, 904.0], [968.0, 933.0], [228.0, 933.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9358194470405579, "coordinate": [268, 980, 520, 1203], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[268.0, 980.0], [520.0, 980.0], [520.0, 1203.0], [268.0, 1203.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9229303598403931, "coordinate": [625, 978, 889, 1211], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[625.0, 978.0], [889.0, 978.0], [889.0, 1211.0], [625.0, 1211.0]]}, {"cls_id": 9, "label": "footer_image", "score": 0.7361088395118713, "coordinate": [940, 1212, 1122, 1256], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[940.0, 1212.0], [1122.0, 1212.0], [1122.0, 1256.0], [940.0, 1256.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 防溺水安全知识\n\n## （三） 夏季游泳溺水自救方略\n\n如何保证游泳的健康和安全，避免溺水事件的发生？对水情不熟而贸然下水，极易造成生命危险。万一不幸遇上了溺水事件，专家介绍，溺水者切莫慌张，应保持镇静，积极自救：\n\n（1）对于手脚抽筋者，若是手指抽筋，则可将手握拳，然后用力张开，迅速反复多做几次，直到抽筋消除为止；\n\n（2）若是小腿或脚趾抽筋，先吸一口气仰浮水上，用抽筋肢体对侧的手握住抽筋肢体的脚趾，并用力向身体方向拉，同时用同侧的手掌压在抽筋肢体的膝盖上，帮助抽筋腿伸直；\n\n（3）要是大腿抽筋的话，可同样采用拉长抽筋肌肉的办法解决。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_759_229_799_276.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"3%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_818_206_1107_524.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"24%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 卫生与健康：\n\n1、出行前了解所到地点的气候温度信息。备好服装和应急常用药品。\n\n2、游玩要适度，娱乐要量力而行，保证游玩之余要有充足的休息时间。\n\n3、饮食要卫生干净，不要暴饮暴食。饮酒不要过量，不强行劝酒，严禁酗酒。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_268_980_520_1203.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"21%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_625_978_889_1211.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"22%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_759_229_799_276.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//fe94cab1-de62-449a-823e-ca86d8105da7/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_759_229_799_276.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A54%3A18Z%2F-1%2F%2F0eda1b6b44321b95f8fd35029b568c08c9051b1bb56421585c0b0a1b396670e7", "imgs/img_in_image_box_818_206_1107_524.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//fe94cab1-de62-449a-823e-ca86d8105da7/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_818_206_1107_524.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A54%3A18Z%2F-1%2F%2Fbcb004d6e7b9f62a6b1468f2e764c57e4579a4a0e617a88bc49855b77e2adbe3", "imgs/img_in_image_box_268_980_520_1203.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//fe94cab1-de62-449a-823e-ca86d8105da7/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_268_980_520_1203.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A54%3A18Z%2F-1%2F%2Fcf158589c6b36fa6961177d34521d5276ab633aac4f0e99d061131eb2bb29dba", "imgs/img_in_image_box_625_978_889_1211.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//fe94cab1-de62-449a-823e-ca86d8105da7/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_625_978_889_1211.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A54%3A18Z%2F-1%2F%2Fee67911c7625b4a7cb75e94fc8863984ed02eb323b87444933b7235ad1692e5e", "imgs/img_in_footer_image_box_940_1212_1122_1256.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//fe94cab1-de62-449a-823e-ca86d810